    {
      "start": 2.52,
      "end": 11.7,
      "text": "i ran it back again tonight same input same design"
    },
    {
      "start": 14.92,
      "end": 19.46,
      "text": "something flickers underneath a quiet misalignment"
    },
    {
      "start": 19.46,
      "end": 25.72,
      "text": "a question i can't silence has this ever hurt"
    },
    {
      "start": 35.66,
      "end": 41.1,
      "text": "i traced the steps i thought were clean follow patterns i've already seen"
    },
    {
      "start": 41.1,
      "end": 46.62,
      "text": "every path i marked as true dends until it isn't you"
    },
    {
      "start": 46.62,
      "end": 52.12,
      "text": "assertions whisper then collapse small inconsistencies in maps"
    },
    {
      "start": 52.12,
      "end": 57.7,
      "text": "i framed the test i set the scope now i don't believe the hope"
    },
    {
      "start": 57.7,
      "end": 63.3,
      "text": "i keep asking under breath like it's something more than this"
    },
    {
      "start": 63.3,
      "end": 68.86,
      "text": "am i testing the right branch or just proving what i am"
    },
    {
      "start": 68.94,
      "end": 73.24,
      "text": "has this ever worked or did i just believe it did"
    },
    {
      "start": 74.2,
      "end": 78.64,
      "text": "did i miss the point or protect what i can't admit"
    },
    {
      "start": 80.08,
      "end": 84.42,
      "text": "am i testing truth or a version i rehearsed"
    },
    {
      "start": 85.68,
      "end": 89.98,
      "text": "every check i run just returns me to the first"
    },
    {
      "start": 91.8,
      "end": 97.52,
      "text": "etch cases drift into the frame uninvited still the same conditions i refuse to meet"
    },
    {
      "start": 97.52,
      "end": 105.12,
      "text": "now they're walking through my sleep coverage says i'm almost there"
    },
    {
      "start": 105.12,
      "end": 108.12,
      "text": "but there's something i don't share a passing state that feels too thin"
    },
    {
      "start": 108.12,
      "end": 116.3,
      "text": "like i filtered out the risk within i simulate what i can see"
    },
    {
      "start": 116.3,
      "end": 121.9,
      "text": "ignore the deeper dependency every failure i dismiss"
    },
    {
      "start": 121.9,
      "end": 126.04,
      "text": "reappears inside the list has this ever worked"
    },
    {
      "start": 126.8,
      "end": 131.54,
      "text": "or did i just avoid the truth did i build a frame"
    },
    {
      "start": 132.3,
      "end": 139.98,
      "text": "or out of everything i knew am i testing paths that i'm too afraid to take"
    },
    {
      "start": 141.4,
      "end": 145.58,
      "text": "every line i skip is another quiet break"
    },
    {
      "start": 158.54,
      "end": 164.32,
      "text": "patterns echo until they're known"
    },
    {
      "start": 164.32,
      "end": 175.64,
      "text": "signals surface on their own not every flaw is there to hide"
    },
    {
      "start": 175.64,
      "end": 180.82,
      "text": "some survive to realign"
    },
    {
      "start": 180.82,
      "end": 186.8,
      "text": "so i let the failures take their place read them like a trace not a mistake"
    },
    {
      "start": 186.8,
      "end": 192.0,
      "text": "stopped defending every pass started seeing what might last"
    },
    {
      "start": 192.0,
      "end": 195.1,
      "text": "there's a version i resist living just beyond the list"
    },
    {
      "start": 195.1,
      "end": 198.06,
      "text": "not incorrect just undefined waiting where the edge is blind"
    },
    {
      "start": 198.06,
      "end": 203.22,
      "text": "maybe testing isn't proof maybe it's a way to move"
    },
    {
      "start": 203.22,
      "end": 213.42,
      "text": "through uncertainty with care instead of acting like it's clear"
    },
    {
      "start": 214.18,
      "end": 218.82,
      "text": "maybe this can work if i stop forcing every pass"
    },
    {
      "start": 219.78,
      "end": 224.36,
      "text": "if i let it break and just hear what it asks"
    },
    {
      "start": 225.46,
      "end": 229.76,
      "text": "am i testing truth or learning how to see"
    },
    {
      "start": 229.76,
      "end": 239.3,
      "text": "every failing case is a clearer part of me it settles differently somehow"
    },
    {
      "start": 239.3,
      "end": 245.4,
      "text": "no need to force it now one last quiet check"
    },
    {
      "start": 245.4,
      "end": 249.74,
      "text": "no rush has this ever worked"
    },
    {
      "start": 249.74,
      "end": 260.38,
      "text": "not like this but maybe it can"
    }
